Subject: [PATCH] fix(import): accept the Solidcraft design extension alias

Route .solidcraft through the checked .sc importer and native GUI filter.
Pin MCP cached-body import, named refusal, and case-insensitive drops.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #2445
